OL,3,GNEWSACorrie Mckeague's mum: 'We did all
OL,4,Awe could to find him'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We definitely did all we could and I
OL,7,Fcan honestly sleep at night knowing
OL,8,Fthere was nothing I physically could
OL,9,Fhave done any different."
OL,11,FIt is 10 years since Nicola Urquhart's
OL,12,Fson, Corrie Mckeague, disappeared on 24
OL,13,FSeptember 2016 after a night out in
OL,14,FBury St Edmunds, Suffolk. For the
OL,15,Fmonths and years that followed, she
OL,16,Fembodied a mother's love and
OL,17,Fdetermination to find the truth: to
OL,18,Fnever give up.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
